'''PPT48''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]] increases freeze time while decreasing time between attacks and recharge. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

